--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0b5213f75801e214d8fb9ad8f5b8cac8, type: 3}
  m_Name: Game_2_StoryDatabase
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryDatabaseSO
  eventConfigs:
  - eventTypeKey: Monster1
    encounterStages:
    - stageName: First
      messages:
      - Holy shit! Why is it always me?!
      - Wait, light. It hates light!
      - Press F! Flashlight, come on!
      voiceClips:
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: d0828cb770c4e6446b8b6e81fdcd094a, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 18aca4ff5c52ad64b9c933080aedc836, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 804980375e784d643b0f2e5ad2a1ee00, type: 3}
    - stageName: Second
      messages:
      - ...
      - Motherfucker!
      - Can you just leave me alone?!
      voiceClips:
      - {fileID: 0}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: c49054cf7b5049b438475ebf9ba2738f, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2c040a8efa53b9048ac98c587aa7fc94, type: 3}
    - stageName: Third
      messages:
      - ...
      - ' I seriously need to go pay my respects at a temple after this.'
      voiceClips:
      - {fileID: 0}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: a57ea6a57d282844288fcb0ee1d7d83c, type: 3}
  - eventTypeKey: Monster2
    encounterStages:
    - stageName: First
      messages:
      - Wait, the hell is that?
      - Oh god, NOPE! NIGERUNDAYO!
      - Wait, wait a sec...
      - It stopped... Okay, it's fine as long as I don't shine the flashlight on
        it.
      voiceClips:
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 880946f6e787fb64da9b00feddca40c3, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2a3806a4f7a7a904190ef4090afca844, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 09fa08625a6c01e41a5f130921650b89, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: e24b942254663cf4bb0802c93f4efa6d, type: 3}
    - stageName: Second
      messages:
      - Okay... pitch black is good. Pitch black is safe.
      - Just let me catch my breath...
      voiceClips:
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8274eaf1afd83864ba1d218b8efcf9fa, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: dc3b595d10d22fc47b8e86a3bc0998de, type: 3}
    - stageName: 'Third '
      messages:
      - Alright, alright... just need to rest a bit more.
      - Wait, did I turn the flashlight off?! Let me check!
      voiceClips:
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 70ff9fba108d09940ac0d52dfb89075c, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4b71275236a765f4d87f8eb76afc6165, type: 3}
  - eventTypeKey: LaserPuzzle2D
    encounterStages:
    - stageName: First
      messages:
      - What the... a laser guide?
      - Guess it matches that mirror pattern I saw.
      - Just press E to rotate it... guide the beam to the receiver. I can do this.
      voiceClips:
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 202602cc25e867b448fef41aef202702, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7d31cf3b8e438424ea3cb36cb59df404, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 15dfbdfb5227f6540a25035c2d8dfd50, type: 3}
    - stageName: 'Second '
      messages:
      - 'Another laser puzzle. Of course. Let''s try this again.  '
      - God, please let this be the last one.
      voiceClips:
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 488c97bab1d973140a24b81602f664c9, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: b71d9cbb13a301744b1bbee3b2a88b5f, type: 3}
    - stageName: 'Third '
      messages:
      - ...
      - FUCK.
      voiceClips:
      - {fileID: 0}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 98835701e62a3fb4ab5eea961a19556b, type: 3}
  - eventTypeKey: LaserPuzzle3D
    encounterStages:
    - stageName: Intro
      messages:
      - Wait a minute... is that the Neo Armstrong Cyclone Jet Armstrong Cannon?
      - Damn, it actually has a really high-quality finish!
      - Focus, man. I need to adjust these mirrors to hit all the sensors.
      - So I gotta get close, press E, and use W, A, S, D, to rotate them......all
        while dodging that thing's attacks. Perfect
      - Great, the flashlight is completely useless.
      - And it doesn't even have eyes. What an absolute unit.
      - Okay... let's try inching closer, then freeze.
      - If it doesn't attack me when I'm still... it must be hunting by sound.
      voiceClips:
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 00c0af0e48403364491ae4b93e0a4bdb, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: dad05b4c01ff3cf41bcbd081c4d66987, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: cd38bfb0a89716143b349d757d25d1d8, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: dedf6715ab386644093e53792272885c, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: c365bab10e7237e46ac78d7c44d4f143, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 159398ce589adbc4abb0fd03cf9d4e83, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8d26ff55102bab6459cd65b1b542abf8, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2637524cfa16802419442c95f7e048f2, type: 3}
  - eventTypeKey: EnterGame2
    encounterStages:
    - stageName: Intro
      messages:
      - Ugh... FUCK. Where the hell am I?
      - Seriously, when will I be able to leave this awful place?
      - Okay... I'll just keep searching for a way out.
      - Hopefully, I can finally get out of this hellish place.
      voiceClips:
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: f827d581161c97a4c8ba2b07d3dde887, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: ee195e3c6dfa4c94ba1aeb272441794f, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6860df5b67350b0448e66005d0298e5a, type: 3}
      - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3dd9046daf4a0a445862d4380a5a4960, type: 3}
